## Deliverable

A revised B1528 SIROCCO current/rudder force calculation package that uses the approved #2760 defaults and sign conventions, separates current-on-ship and rudder-load sections, uses generic OCIMF MEG4 current coefficients with provenance, removes main-presentation resultant force calculations, includes simple section-specific plan-view schematics, and regenerates Markdown/HTML/Word/PDF deliverables with TDD-backed regression coverage.

---

## Pseudocode

```text
function load_b1528_revision_config():
    load existing B1528 geometry and rudder constants
    set default current_speed = 3.08 kn
    set current speed range = 0..4 kn
    set default heading = +5 deg port/off bow
    set rudder sweep = 0..28 deg port in 2 deg steps
    set axes = +X forward, +Y port, +Z up, +N bow-to-port
    set CoG = midship, z = 6.1 m above keel
    validate output locations and presentation settings
```

```text
function load_generic_ocimf_current_coefficients(source):
    locate existing production CSV if available
    if unavailable, load bounded digitized fixture checked into repo with citation/provenance fields
    validate required columns: heading, CXc, CYc, CMc
    normalize heading to port-positive/off-bow convention
    interpolate coefficients for requested headings
    return coefficient values plus provenance/citation sidecar
```

```text
function calculate_current_on_ship(case):
    V = current_speed_kn * 0.51444
    q = 0.5 * rho_water * V^2
    coeffs = load/interpolate OCIMF CXc, CYc, CMc for heading
    X = q * frontal_current_area * CXc, transformed to +X forward convention
    Y = q * lateral_current_area * CYc, signed +Y port
    N_ocimf = q * lateral_current_area * L_ref * CMc, signed +N bow-to-port
    N_force_arm = Y * derived_or_reported_lever_arm, used only in side-by-side verification chart
    return X, Y, N_ocimf, N_force_arm, coefficients, provenance
```

```text
function calculate_rudder_loads(case):
    simple_default = area_drag_model(current_speed, rudder_angle, rudder_area, rho, Cd/reference)
    alternate_existing = existing_B1528/Barrass force-family model with Cr=1.0 and same sign convention
    convert both into ship-fixed X/Y/N at CoG using approved yaw lever/reference
    return separate default and alternate outputs with source notes
```

```text
function build_report(result):
    create sections: intro, design data/assumptions, current-on-ship, rudder-load, limitations/traceability
    add section-specific plan-view schematic using transparent/simple ship polygon, CoG, X/Y/N arrows, default values
    add OCIMF coefficient plots and current force plots -5..+5 deg at 1 deg intervals if required for heading plots
    add scalar charts only: current X, current Y, current N, rudder X, rudder Y, rudder N, plus one yaw verification chart
    avoid main-presentation resultant forces and heatmaps
    round kN/kN-m large values to 0 decimals; use 1 decimal for angles
    write Markdown, HTML, Word, PDF, CSV/JSON/provenance/manifest
```

