## Acceptance Criteria

- [ ] Plan adversarial review completed by Claude/Codex/Gemini or documented approved fallback; MAJOR findings resolved before `status:plan-review`.
- [ ] Issue #2760 receives the final reviewed plan and waits for explicit user approval before implementation.
- [ ] TDD red tests are written first in `digitalmodel` for the #2760 report/calculation contract.
- [ ] The implementation uses approved defaults/signs/datum and removes stale 3.5 kn / ±1–5° main scenario presentation.
- [ ] OCIMF current-on-ship calculation uses actual generic/digitized coefficient source with provenance and limitations, not placeholder sine/cosine-only coefficients.
- [ ] Current section includes coefficient plots, default sample calculation, and force plots over -5° to +5° at 1° intervals.
- [ ] Rudder section includes 0° to 28° port sweep in 2° increments and side-by-side simple/default vs alternate/existing hydrodynamic model comparison.
- [ ] Report has separate sections for current load and rudder load, with section-specific plan-view schematics showing ship outline, CoG, actual angles, `X`, `Y`, and `N` signs/magnitudes.
- [ ] Resultant force calculations are removed from main report presentation; heatmap removed; charts are single-variable except the one approved yaw verification comparison.
- [ ] Markdown and HTML outputs regenerate in `digitalmodel`; Word and PDF outputs regenerate in `acma-projects`.
- [ ] Tests pass for targeted files: `uv run pytest tests/naval_architecture/test_b1528_sirocco_current_heading_rudder.py tests/naval_architecture/test_b1528_sirocco_moored_current.py -v` from `/mnt/local-analysis/digitalmodel`.
- [ ] Broader relevant regression passes or failures are documented as unrelated/pre-existing.
- [ ] Final issue comment links updated deliverables back to #2760 and parent #2642.

